//#				images from Luminary 1A.
// PORT: SOURCE INTEGRATION_INITIALIZATION.agc:13
//#		2011-01-06 JL	Fixed pseudo-label indentation.
// PORT: SOURCE INTEGRATION_INITIALIZATION.agc:14
//#
// PORT: SOURCE INTEGRATION_INITIALIZATION.agc:15
//# This source code has been transcribed or otherwise adapted from
